## Key Concepts

- End-to-end multi-user collaboration
- Deterministic OT mock to ensure repeatable runs
- WebSocket presence and real-time cursor synchronization
- Test data isolation and idempotent retries
- Tooling trade-offs between Playwright and Cypress

